Extracting in place uses hatchzip, a free open-source tool (MIT/Apache 2.0) by
xevrion. It is not installed yet.

▌ ▸ Install hatchzip with Scoop
▌   Adds the xevrion bucket, then installs hatchzip. No admin needed.

    Not now
    Go back

Devpit will run exactly:
  scoop bucket add xevrion https://github.com/xevrion/scoop-bucket
  scoop install xevrion/hatchzip

